  "html": "<h2>The same relations, on GitLab’s page</h2>\n<div class=\"split\" style=\"grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr)\">\n  <figure><img src=\"media/gl504.png\" alt=\"GitLab's page for merge request !504, with five numbered boxes: the title, the merged state, the head sha, the squash merge and the note\"></figure>\n  <div class=\"rows\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">1</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:pulls-get</b></code><br>Read merge request 504, kept as pr.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">2</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>state, merged</b></code><br>GitLab’s merged becomes state: closed, merged: true.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">3</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>head.sha</b></code><br>GitLab’s sha: it merges only if the source head is still there.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">4</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:merge {method: squash}</b></code><br>“Changes merged into main with 8ef9444b (commits were squashed).”</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">5</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:comment {body}</b></code><br>The same comment, as a GitLab note.</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
  "say": "Merge request !504 on the GitLab running on this machine, the same variant, the same script. Same five things, different words on the page: GitLab says merge request, Merged, pr-504 into main, commits were squashed. ARTIE read and sent the same scm: relations on both.",
